---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Reisekostenrechner für Marokko: Budgetschätzer für 2026";
const description = "Berechnen Sie in Sekundenschnelle Ihre Reisekosten nach Marokko im Jahr 2026. Echtzeit-Budgetkalkulator für Privatfahrer, Luxus-Riads, Wüstencamps in der Sahara und individuelle Rundstrecken.";
const canonical = "https://roammorocco.tours/de/morocco-trip-cost-calculator.html";
const ogImage = "https://roammorocco.tours/images/hero-desert.jpg";
const bodyClass = "roam-light-theme";
const extraStyles = ["/css/trip-estimator.css?v=20260929"];
const schema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "@id": "https://roammorocco.tours/#website",
      "name": "Roam Morocco Tours",
      "url": "https://roammorocco.tours/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "TravelAgency",
      "@id": "https://roammorocco.tours/#agency",
      "name": "Roam Morocco Tours",
      "url": "https://roammorocco.tours/",
      "telephone": "+212 653-506441",
      "priceRange": "$$",
      "address": {
        "@type": "PostalAddress",
        "streetAddress": "N4, Immeuble, 38 Rue Tariq Bnou Ziad",
        "addressLocality": "Marrakech",
        "postalCode": "40000",
        "addressCountry": "MA"
      },
      "founder": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Hamza",
          "jobTitle": "Co-Founder & Expedition Curator"
        },
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Abdelhakim",
          "jobTitle": "Co-Founder & Operations Lead"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebApplication",
      "@id": "https://roammorocco.tours/morocco-trip-cost-calculator.html#app",
      "name": "Morocco Trip Cost & Route Estimator",
      "url": "https://roammorocco.tours/morocco-trip-cost-calculator.html",
      "applicationCategory": "TravelApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "All",
      "description": "Interactive travel cost and driving route calculator for planning custom trips across Morocco, private chauffeurs, luxury riads, and Sahara desert expeditions.",
      "aggregateRating": {
        "@type": "AggregateRating",
        "ratingValue": "5.0",
        "bestRating": "5",
        "worstRating": "1",
        "ratingCount": "985",
        "reviewCount": "985"
      },
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "0",
        "priceCurrency": "USD",
        "priceValidUntil": "2027-12-31"
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": "https://roammorocco.tours/morocco-trip-cost-calculator.html#faq",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does a 10-day trip to Morocco typically cost?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A mid-range to luxury 10-day private trip to Morocco typically costs between \u20ac1,100 and \u20ac1,750 ($1,200 to $1,900 USD) per person based on two travelers sharing a room. This includes a dedicated English-speaking private driver with an executive Prado 4x4 or Mercedes minivan, authentic boutique riad accommodations with breakfast, a luxury private tent in Erg Chebbi with camel trekking, licensed medina guides, fuel, and highway tolls."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Morocco expensive for tourists?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Morocco offers exceptional value compared to Western Europe or North America. High-quality dining costs \u20ac8 to \u20ac20 per person, magnificent historic riads range from \u20ac50 to \u20ac140 per night, and private chauffeurs cost \u20ac135 to \u20ac180 per day all-inclusive. You can experience 5-star level hospitality and private logistics at a fraction of European prices."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the biggest cost factor in a Moroccan vacation?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Private transportation and accommodation tier are the two primary drivers of cost. Because Morocco is geographically vast\u2014spanning mountain ranges and desert expanses\u2014hiring a private 4x4 with a licensed chauffeur represents the core investment in comfort, safety, and flexible scheduling."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are credit cards widely accepted, or do I need cash?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "While luxury riads, high-end restaurants, and tour agencies accept Visa and Mastercard, Morocco remains largely a cash-driven economy. Cash (Moroccan Dirham - MAD) is essential for souk shopping, tipping, roadside cafes, and local artisan stalls. ATMs are readily available in all major towns."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout lang="de" title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogImage={ogImage} bodyClass={bodyClass} extraStyles={extraStyles} schema={schema}>
  <style is:inline slot="head">

    body {
      background-color: #f2eee6;
      color: #000000;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .calc-hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 130px 24px 60px;
      background: #f2eee6;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .calc-kicker {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      background: rgba(200, 164, 92, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200, 164, 92, 0.28);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #8A6A23;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .calc-kicker::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #C8A45C;
    }

    .calc-hero h1 {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 62px);
      line-height: 1.0;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .calc-hero-sub {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 21px);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72);
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto 32px;
    }

    .calc-trust-strip {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .calc-pill {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 7px 16px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
    }

    .calc-pill span {
      color: #C8A45C;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    /* FAQ Section */
    .faq-wrap {
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 60px auto 40px;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }


    /* Bourdain Quote */
    .field-note-box {
      background: #faf8f5;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-left: 4px solid #C8A45C;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
  
  </style>

  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <header class="calc-hero">
    <div class="calc-kicker">INTERACTIVE BUDGET CALCULATOR • 2026 EDITION</div>
    <h1>Reisekosten- und Routenkalkulator für Marokko</h1>
    <p class="calc-hero-sub">Schätzen Sie Ihr realistisches Marokko-Reisebudget in Sekundenschnelle. Wählen Sie Ihre bevorzugte Strecke, passen Sie die Dauer an, wählen Sie die Komfortstufe Ihrer Unterkunft aus und erhalten Sie sofort eine detaillierte Kostenaufschlüsselung mit Fahrzeiten.</p>

    <div class="calc-trust-strip">
      <div class="calc-pill"><span>✓</span> 100% Real Pricing Benchmarks</div>
      <div class="calc-pill"><span>✓</span> Fuel, Tolls &amp; Chauffeur Lodging Included</div>
      <div class="calc-pill"><span>✓</span> Verified Boutique Riads &amp; Luxury Camps</div>
      <div class="calc-pill"><span>✓</span> No Forced Tourist Stops</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main style="max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px;">

    <!-- THE INTERACTIVE ESTIMATOR WIDGET -->
    <div id="roamEstimator" class="estimator-container">
      <div class="estimator-grid">

        <!-- Left Controls Column -->
        <div class="estimator-controls">
          
          <!-- STEP 1: ROUTE SELECTION -->
          <div class="est-step-block">
            <div class="est-step-head">
              <h3 class="est-step-title"><span class="est-step-num">1</span> Wählen Sie Ihre Route</h3>
              <span class="est-current-val" id="estRouteVal">Signature Desert Circuit</span>
            </div>
            <div class="est-route-cards">
              <!-- Route 1 -->
              <div class="est-route-card selected" data-route="marrakech-desert-fes">
                <h4 class="est-route-name">Von Marrakesch nach Fes über die Sahara</h4>
                <p class="est-route-desc">Hoher Atlas, Ait Benhaddou, Dades-Schlucht, Dünen von Erg Chebbi und Medina von Fes. (1.050 km)</p>
              </div>
              <!-- Route 2 -->
              <div class="est-route-card" data-route="imperial-cities-north">
                <h4 class="est-route-name">Kaiserstädte und Blaue Perle</h4>
                <p class="est-route-desc">Casablanca, Rabat, die blauen Gassen von Chefchaouen, die Ruinen von Volubilis und Fes. (950 km)</p>
              </div>
              <!-- Route 3 -->
              <div class="est-route-card" data-route="marrakech-coast-atlas">
                <h4 class="est-route-name">Marrakesch, Küste und Atlas</h4>
                <p class="est-route-desc">Basis in Marrakesch mit Tagesausflügen: Küste von Essaouira, Fluss Ourika und Sonnenuntergang in Agafay. (480 km)</p>
              </div>
              <!-- Route 4 -->
              <div class="est-route-card" data-route="grand-morocco-loop">
                <h4 class="est-route-name">Großer Marokko-Rundkurs</h4>
                <p class="est-route-desc">Casablanca, Chefchaouen, Fes, Merzouga Sahara, Marrakesch und Atlantikküste. (2.250 km)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 2: TRIP DURATION SLIDER -->
          <div class="est-step-block">
            <div class="est-step-head">
              <h3 class="est-step-title"><span class="est-step-num">2</span> Reisedauer</h3>
              <span class="est-current-val" id="estDaysVal">4 Days</span>
            </div>
            <div class="est-slider-wrap">
              <input type="range" id="estSliderDays" class="est-range-slider" min="3" max="7" value="4">
              <div class="est-slider-ticks">
                <span id="estSliderMin">3 Days</span>
                <span>Paced Comfortably</span>
                <span id="estSliderMax">7 Days</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 3: TRAVEL COMFORT TIER -->
          <div class="est-step-block">
            <div class="est-step-head">
              <h3 class="est-step-title"><span class="est-step-num">3</span> Unterkunft und Stil</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="est-pills-row">
              <div class="est-pill" data-est-style="boutique">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Authentic Boutique</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">Charming 3★ Riads &amp; Standard Camp</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-pill selected" data-est-style="luxury">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Curated Luxury</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">Premium 4/5★ Riads &amp; Royal Camp</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-pill" data-est-style="palace">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Royal Palace / VIP</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">5★ Palace Stays &amp; Presidential Suite</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 4: PARTY SIZE -->
          <div class="est-step-block">
            <div class="est-step-head">
              <h3 class="est-step-title"><span class="est-step-num">4</span> Anzahl der Reisenden</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="est-pills-row">
              <div class="est-pill" data-est-group="solo">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Solo Traveler</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">1 Person / 1 Room</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-pill selected" data-est-group="couple">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Couple</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">2 People / 1 Double</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-pill" data-est-group="family">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Family (3–4)</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">3–4 People / 2 Rooms</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-pill" data-est-group="group">
                <span class="est-pill-label">Small Group (5–8)</span>
                <span class="est-pill-sub">Executive VIP Minivan</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Right Summary Sticky Column -->
        <div class="estimator-summary-card">
          <!-- Currency Switcher -->
          <div class="est-curr-toggle">
            <button type="button" class="curr-btn active" data-curr="EUR">EUR (€)</button>
            <button type="button" class="curr-btn" data-curr="USD">USD ($)</button>
          </div>

          <span class="est-total-kicker">Estimated Total Trip Range</span>
          <div class="est-total-amount" id="estTotalAmount">€1,230 – €1,360</div>
          
          <div class="est-per-person" id="estPerPersonVal">
            <span class="badge">~€162 / person / day</span> based on Couple
          </div>

          <!-- Category Breakdown -->
          <div class="est-breakdown-list">
            <!-- Transport -->
            <div class="est-cat-row">
              <div class="est-cat-meta">
                <span class="name">🚗 Private Chauffeur &amp; 4x4 / Van</span>
                <span class="price" id="estValTransport">€620</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-meter-track"><div class="est-meter-bar" id="estMeterTransport" style="width: 48%;"></div></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Lodging -->
            <div class="est-cat-row">
              <div class="est-cat-meta">
                <span class="name">🏨 Boutique Riads &amp; Desert Camp</span>
                <span class="price" id="estValLodging">€345</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-meter-track"><div class="est-meter-bar" id="estMeterLodging" style="width: 27%;"></div></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Experiences -->
            <div class="est-cat-row">
              <div class="est-cat-meta">
                <span class="name">🐫 Desert Trek &amp; Guided Excursions</span>
                <span class="price" id="estValExp">€130</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-meter-track"><div class="est-meter-bar" id="estMeterExp" style="width: 10%;"></div></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Food -->
            <div class="est-cat-row">
              <div class="est-cat-meta">
                <span class="name">🍽️ Meals, Fresh Juices &amp; Per Diem</span>
                <span class="price" id="estValFood">€200</span>
              </div>
              <div class="est-meter-track"><div class="est-meter-bar" id="estMeterFood" style="width: 15%;"></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Route Driving Schedule Intel -->
          <div class="est-route-intel">
            <div class="est-intel-title">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="#C8A45C"><path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7zm0 9.5c-1.38 0-2.5-1.12-2.5-2.5s1.12-2.5 2.5-2.5 2.5 1.12 2.5 2.5-1.12 2.5-2.5 2.5z"/></svg>
              <span id="estIntelRouteName">Marrakech to Fes via Merzouga Sahara</span>
            </div>
            <div id="estIntelDist" style="margin-bottom: 3px; font-weight:700;">Route Distance: 1,050 km</div>
            <div id="estIntelTime" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Driving Schedule: 16–18 hours total driving over 3–5 days</div>
            <div id="estIntelHighlight" style="color: #666; font-style: italic;">Crosses 2,260m Tizi n'Tichka pass. Sunset camel trek over 150m golden dunes.</div>
          </div>

          <!-- CTA Lock In -->
          <div class="est-action-area">
            <button type="button" class="btn-lock-quote" id="estTriggerLeadBtn">
              Lock In This Estimate &amp; Get Itinerary &rarr;
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Lead Capture Inline Form -->
          <div class="est-lead-modal" id="estLeadModal">
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px; font-size:16px; font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight:800;">Erhalten Sie Ihr detailliertes Angebot</h4>
            <p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:13px; color:#666;">Wir prüfen die Riad-Verfügbarkeit für Ihre Daten und senden Ihnen innerhalb von 30 Minuten eine E-Mail.</p>

            <form id="estLeadForm" class="est-lead-form">
              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Full Name *" required>
              <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Your Email Address *" required>
              <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="WhatsApp / Phone Number *" required>
              <textarea name="notes" rows="2" placeholder="Approximate travel month, flight status, or specific wishes..."></textarea>
              <button type="submit" id="estSubmitLeadBtn" class="btn-lock-quote" style="background:#C8A45C; color:#000; font-weight:900;">
                Send Itinerary Request &rarr;
              </button>
              <div id="estLeadMsg" class="est-lead-msg"></div>
            </form>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- BUDGETING INSIGHTS SECTION -->
    <section style="margin: 60px 0; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-radius: 16px; padding: 48px 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
      <span style="font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#8A6A23;">Transparent Cost Factors</span>
      <h2 style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 34px); font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; margin:8px 0 20px;">Wohin fließt Ihr Geld in Marokko?</h2>
      
      <p style="font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:16px; line-height:1.7; color:#333;">Marokko bietet Reisenden eines der besten Preis-Luxus-Verhältnisse im weltweiten Reiseverkehr. Da sich die Tourismuslogistik in Marokko jedoch erheblich von der auf die Schiene ausgerichteten Europa unterscheidet, hilft das Verständnis, wie sich die Tagesbudgets aufteilen, kostspielige Überraschungen zu vermeiden:</p>

      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap:24px; margin-top:28px;">
        <div style="background:#faf8f5; padding:22px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:12px;">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">1. Privater Transport (35–45 %)</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#555; margin:0;">Bei langen Strecken, Serpentinen in den Bergen (Tizi n'Tichka-Pass) und Wüstenstrecken ist ein engagierter, lizenzierter Chauffeur und ein 4x4-Prado oder Mercedes die wichtigste Investition in Komfort und Seelenfrieden.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background:#faf8f5; padding:22px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:12px;">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">2. Riad-Aufenthalte (30–40 %)</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#555; margin:0;">Historische marokkanische Riads mit Innenhöfen, Brunnengärten und Dachterrassen bieten Luxus zu erschwinglichen Preisen. Das Frühstück ist fast überall im Preis inbegriffen und umfasst frisches Gebäck und Orangensaft.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background:#faf8f5; padding:22px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:12px;">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">3. Essen und Trinken (15–20 %)</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#555; margin:0;">Frische Tajine, Pastillas, Salate und Minztee kosten in hochwertigen Medina-Restaurants zwischen 8 und 20 € pro Person. Die Preise für gehobene Palastgastronomie liegen zwischen 40 und 80 Euro.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="background:#faf8f5; padding:22px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-radius:12px;">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px; font-size:16px; font-weight:800;">4. Anleitungen und Tipps (5–10 %)</h4>
          <p style="font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6; color:#555; margin:0;">Offizielle lokale Medina-Führer in Fes und Marrakesch kosten 30–50 € pro halben Tag. Das Trinkgeld für Fahrer beträgt für ein Paar durchschnittlich 100–150 MAD (10–15 €) pro Tag.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="field-note-box">
        <span style="font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#8A6A23;">Anthony Bourdain Travel Philosophy</span>
        <blockquote style="font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style:italic; font-size:16px; line-height:1.65; color:#222; margin:8px 0 10px;">„Reisen ist nicht immer schön. Es ist nicht immer bequem. Manchmal tut es weh, es bricht sogar das Herz. Aber das ist in Ordnung. Die Reise verändert dich; sie sollte dich verändern. Sie hinterlässt Spuren in deinem Gedächtnis, in deinem Bewusstsein, in deinem Herzen und in deinem Körper.“</blockquote>
        <div style="font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:#666;">— Roam Morocco Curators: Hamza &amp; Abdelhakim</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQS SECTION -->
    <div class="faq-wrap">
      <div style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px;">
        <span style="font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#8A6A23;">Travel Budgeting Intelligence</span>
        <h2 style="font-family:Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:28px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; margin:8px 0;">Häufig gestellte Fragen</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-accordion">
        <div class="faq-item active">
          <h4 class="faq-question">Wie viel kostet normalerweise eine 10-tägige Reise nach Marokko?</h4>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Eine 10-tägige Privatreise nach Marokko der mittleren bis luxuriösen Mittelklasse kostet in der Regel zwischen <strong>1.100 und 1.750 € (1.200 bis 1.900 USD) pro Person</strong>, wenn zwei Reisende sich ein Zimmer teilen. Dazu gehören ein engagierter englischsprachiger Privatfahrer mit einem Executive Prado 4x4 oder einem Mercedes-Minivan, authentische Boutique-Riad-Unterkünfte mit Frühstück, ein luxuriöses Privatzelt in Erg Chebbi mit Kameltrekking, lizenzierte Medina-Führer, Treibstoff und Autobahngebühren.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4 class="faq-question">Ist Marokko für Touristen teuer?</h4>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Marokko bietet im Vergleich zu Westeuropa oder Nordamerika ein außergewöhnliches Preis-Leistungs-Verhältnis. Hochwertiges Essen kostet 8 bis 20 Euro pro Person, prächtige historische Riads kosten 50 bis 140 Euro pro Nacht und private Chauffeure kosten 135 bis 180 Euro pro Tag inklusive All-Inclusive. Sie können Gastfreundschaft und private Logistik auf 5-Sterne-Niveau zu einem Bruchteil der europäischen Preise erleben.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4 class="faq-question">Was ist der größte Kostenfaktor bei einem Marokko-Urlaub?</h4>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Der private Transport und die Unterbringung sind die beiden Hauptkostentreiber. Da Marokko geografisch riesig ist und sich über Bergketten und Wüsten erstreckt, stellt die Anmietung eines privaten Geländewagens mit einem lizenzierten Chauffeur die wichtigste Investition in Komfort, Sicherheit und flexible Terminplanung dar.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <h4 class="faq-question">Werden Kreditkarten allgemein akzeptiert oder benötige ich Bargeld?</h4>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <p>Während Luxus-Riads, Spitzenrestaurants und Reisebüros Visa und Mastercard akzeptieren, bleibt Marokko weitgehend eine bargeldbasierte Wirtschaft. Bargeld (Marokkanischer Dirham – MAD) ist für Einkäufe in Souks, Trinkgelder, Straßencafés und lokale Kunsthandwerksstände unerlässlich. In allen größeren Städten stehen Geldautomaten zur Verfügung.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

